{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\PowerShell\\\\7\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"rg -n -C 2 'THE EDGE WRITE' docs/test/test-cases.toml\"","aggregated_output":"2130-verifies = [\"SR-220\", \"LLR-210\", \"IF-177\", \"IF-178\"]\n2131-level = \"Integration\"\n2132:method = \"Driven in process, in a fast module, on hand-built rows and a directory tree with no git. THE SELECTION, its candidate sets seeded from the queue-conflict detector's pairs and its recorded digest hashing the spine registries through the carrier resolver: the queue digest moves for each of the four fields that change the question and stands still for the two that do not; a malformed digest cell reads as no recorded digest; each of the two new signals fires where the pair producer is blind and the module signal does not fire on a bare module name; two disjoint overlapping pairs make ONE candidate set; two rows only the queue-conflict detector pairs (near-identical titles, different specs, no shared edge or module) still make a candidate set; and the spine digest moves with a CSV-only carrier's content and is refused when both carriers are present. THE POPULATION: two judgement rows sharing a spec make no candidate set and leave the queue digest unmoved, and the example row makes none. THE GUARDS: no row is drafted while a judgement is active, while another consolidation row is queued, while a queued judgement names a candidate row, or while a queued judgement's priority equals or exceeds the consolidation's so that the scheduler orders it first, and each refusal names that judgement; a queued judgement naming no candidate at a lower priority refuses nothing; a queue state a done consolidation row already carries drafts nothing, naming that row; the successor of a done consolidation row whose recorded outcome is consolidate and whose draft supersedes the absorbed rows seeds no candidate set; a consolidation row whose recorded outcome is queue, queue-with-edge or return-to-draft, one cancelled, or one whose scope carries no recorded verdict makes no successor, and a hand consolidation's host seeds a candidate set and may be re-absorbed; the brief's prior-consolidation lines mark each absorbed row as judged, naming its judging row, or by hand, row by row within one successor's absorbed set, and a hand host a judgement later absorbed leaves both absorptions listed, each with its own marks; re-absorbing a row a consolidation judgement minted is refused by name; a malformed verdict block refuses, naming what is wrong, and never defaults; the close refuses by name a row that is no longer queued; for a spec in the registry's LF format, an absorbed row's spec, less exactly the inserted Deliverable section, equals the original byte for byte, its SpecRef kept. THE EDGE WRITE: the edge transform inserts a missing top-level `needs` line holding just the blocker at the top of the frontmatter, ahead of any table, the inserted line parses and the rest of the specification is byte-identical; an existing `needs` line is extended exactly as before; and a specification whose frontmatter fence cannot be found, whose frontmatter does not parse, or whose `needs` list is not on one line is refused.\"\n2133-tier = \"Smoke\"\n2134-expected = \"Satisfies the acceptance folded into LLR-210 (parent SR-220): the selection and the guards, each decided without a repository\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
